clear
units metal
dimension 3
boundary f p p
atom_style atomic
read_data input/NEW_MODEL_ATOMS.data
include potentials/potential.interface_calibration_v0.inc
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
variable fmag atom sqrt(fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz)
compute Fmax all reduce max v_fmag
compute Fmean all reduce ave v_fmag
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step atoms pe c_Fmax c_Fmean
thermo_modify format float %.12g lost error flush yes
dump pre all custom 1 pre_relax.dump id type x y z fx fy fz
dump_modify pre sort id
run 0
undump pre
min_style fire
min_modify dmax 0.05
dump relax all custom 25 minimization_frames.dump id type x y z fx fy fz
dump_modify relax sort id
minimize 0.0 0.5 500 5000
undump relax
run 0
write_dump all custom post_relax.dump id type x y z fx fy fz modify sort id format float %.16e
write_data post_relax.data
write_restart post_relax.restart
